    "sections": {
        "description": "Newsum is a next-generation, ultra-fast editorial news and magazine WordPress theme designed for top performance, SEO, and Core Web Vitals. Its lightweight codebase and optimized assets ensure minimal overhead and lightning-fast load times. Fully compatible with the block editor, popular page builders (Elementor, Beaver Builder etc), and WooCommerce, it’s perfect for news publications, tech blogs, digital magazines, investigative journals, and online stores. Featuring dark and light mode switching, multiple hero layouts (bento box, broadsheet, cyber terminal), interactive reading time, and local GDPR-compliant webfonts, Newsum empowers you to create a high-impact, modern publication. Discover everything Newsum has to offer and explore our powerful premium version at https://wpmatcha.com/wordpress-themes/newsum/."
    },
